From: Matthew <matthew@paperly.education>
Date: Thu, 2 Apr 2026 20:15:49 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(discord): DAVE voice receive passthrough with STT
 pipeline

- Add DAVE encryption passthrough for Discord voice channel audio
- Add voice ingress prompt formatting (prompt.ts) and sanitization (sanitize.ts)
- Add sodium-native and @discordjs/opus dependencies for voice
- Configure whisper CLI for audio transcription via tools.media.models
- Fix voice authorization via channels.discord.allowFrom config
